(global_label "RLDOUT" (shape passive) (at 68.58 166.37 180) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify right)) (uuid "d129c1fa-8d05-548e-8907-3347c45baa6a"))
(text "RLDOUT / RLDINV -> U1 pins 63 / 61. RLDREF pin 60 open requires internal midsupply selection.\nA4S bring-up: RLD initially OFF; dummy loads only. Then use CH1 pair only: SENSP=01, SENSN=01.\nNo automatic multi-pair selection: 1F/1F or 3F/3F requires a separate real-load stability review.\nRecording six channels does NOT require six pairs in RLD. 1M || 1n5 is not a stability guarantee.\nR22 + R23 = 220k. Current limiting here is NOT an isolation barrier or safety certification." (at 22 205 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b933c89a-8e7d-590a-8fab-c4d5057c106b"))
(text "Bench verification: no person connected; dummy electrode impedances and realistic cable capacitance.\nDo not connect an earthed oscilloscope, signal generator, debugger or charger to a worn assembly.\nThe board has no on-board galvanic isolation. Use a reviewed external USB isolation/power arrangement." (at 22 256 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ee9bbece-74f4-512d-aae5-085e8a682c26"))
)